WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:06.830
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do: Dr. Bright can not give SCP-082 song requests!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.349
SCP-082 loves to sing.

00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:13.049
If there's anything he loves more than lying
and feasting on human flesh, it's busting

00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:15.249
out a cheerful little tune from time to time.

00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:20.530
However, as Dr. Bright has shown that he cannot
be respectful of SCP-082's tastes, or the

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:26.279
comfort of those working around him, he is
not permitted to request any songs from SCP-082.

00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:31.829
Fernand was recently reduced to tears when
his rendition of a classic Italian aria was

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:37.170
interrupted by Dr. Bright's repeated cries
of "Do Free Bird!" and he also expressed discomfort

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.020
when Dr. Bright told him to perform "Like
a Virgin."

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:44.809
He should know by now that Fernand only likes
to sing one Madonna song, and it's "Vogue."

